Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:10.14,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:12.42,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Since when were you... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Water sploosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know, I don't think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I know that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know even though\NI don't think I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Spike, where the hell are we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this ship was headed for Mars!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are we on Earth\Nall of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, this isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're wasting time, our fugitive...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the first big one in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, why the hell are we on—?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The women are gone. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Listen, if you lead me to that "water sploosh"\Nplace, I'll give you something good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good thing? What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something very, tremendously,\Nwonderfully good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Something very, tremendously,\Nwonderfully good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Water sploosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I shouldn't have trusted you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I found Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed has been found?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:11.50,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,35 point 38 point 0, 35 point\N48 point 1, 35 point 48 point 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This, this, this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have your nails?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nails? {added the hesitation}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm collecting them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the pinky one will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:24.01,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,35 point 52 point 3, 35 point...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This, this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on... can I have it? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:22.78,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,What are you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really you... Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best way\Nto make the kids listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Ed from this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She wandered in about five years ago. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, she was eating with us\Nas if it had always been that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And about three years ago,\Nshe wandered away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As if she was a cat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering how she\Nwas doing nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't think she\Nwould suddenly appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Lord up in the heavens...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind the rest. Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get going now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you can stay longer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually looking for something...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed knows where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just came here for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to gimme something good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something good in\Nthe desk drawer over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Something good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside that drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that. Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He came looking for Ed about 2 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he forgot that he\Nhad put her in an orphanage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and that he had been looking for\N7 years, hopping around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she will be able to meet him...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,People have to cherish what ties they have...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you... Faye?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Sally Yung!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in your high school\Ngraduating class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a ghost.\NYou look just like back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, they say ghosts appear in\Nplaces where they have regrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I remember now. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were put in cold sleep\Nafter that accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why you\Nlook like back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember, Faye?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma, we gotta go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that time already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you don't know. Actually, she's—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this course\Nchange without asking?! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plans have all been\Nscrewed because of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate you\Ndoing things on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to smell something really good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they being so secretive about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're too hungry\Nfor their own good... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans go insane if they don't eat food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,50 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Appledelhi Siniz Hesap Lutfen. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like one, Mackenroe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Macintire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No thank you, Mr. Appledelhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure? Eggs are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, power and charge.\NThat's what's important, Macintosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Macintire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it that you can't ever\Nremember your assistant's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, don't worry about\Nthe small things in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Macky-Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Macintire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally remembered where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You have someone waiting for you, too.\NYou have somewhere you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go look for it, too. {extra lead-out}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best thing, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,50 million is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can eat sukiyaki\Nfilled with meat, then they—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Faye went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Again? Where the hell did she go this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman's heart and\Nthe skies of Ganymede, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Appledelhi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you come along with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooperate with us if you\Ndon't wanna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?\NDon't interrupt our work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this Earth need\Nto regain a peaceful peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This Earth of wild chaos! Is it the cosmos?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a map! A map!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, happiness comes in the form of a map!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are creating maps to save the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A map? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But, meteors fall often\Nand change the landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're globetrotting.\NWe're chasing after every meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Until every single meteor falls onto Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting someone this adept.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Ed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Françoise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And that, and that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is father-person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.39,0:17:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She had such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Spike-person and Jet-person. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, father. Good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking care of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was it daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it's all right either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a token of my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Ed, were you the one\Nwho put the bounty on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty point zero, zero,\Nzero, zero, zero, zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 50 Woolongs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you wanna come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Michael-duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Macintire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's dinner time...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't come with me, Ein.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed is going someplace far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So Ein, you should go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come with Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Ein!
