Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has a beginning... and an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is just a cycle of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.23,0:24:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With unwanted endings, becoming an adult\Nis to experience the inevitable finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a fast trip for Bebop,\Nwith only two episodes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But make sure you pay\Nclose attention to how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.47,0:24:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode: The Real Folk Blues (Part 1).
